  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e07-scene-10",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "布置总监大会会场  (Setting Up the All-Directors Hall)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "bianbian": "边边",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Ordered to prepare the conference hall for an emergency all-directors meeting and convinced Bianbian will back Stella against Chun Yuqiao, Bu Xiaogu works overtime believing tomorrow may be her final day at Xingtian. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "总监全会的系统指令已经下发了，明天我负责布置会场。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "主任说我看了这么久，明天是大结局，让我离近点看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "边边先生，那您到底选哪边？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你不都说了吗，斯戴拉管营销，我当然站她那边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "雷总，我出去接个电话。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天晚上恐怕不行，我想在公司加个班。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明天可能是我在星天的最后一天了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我一个人走，总比让淳于总受影响强。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你放心吧，我都已经想好了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷，你今天来得这么早，真勤劳啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥，淳于总今天还没来吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大在外面有一个重要的谈判，今天我替他出席会议。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那凯文哥，今天一定要加油！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "总监全会的系统指令已经下发了，明天我负责布置会场。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The system order for the all-directors meeting came through, and I am setting up the hall tomorrow.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "主任说我看了这么久，明天是大结局，让我离近点看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My supervisor said after watching from afar so long, tomorrow is the grand finale and I should watch up close.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "边边先生，那您到底选哪边？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Bianbian, which side did you choose in the end?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你不都说了吗，斯戴拉管营销，我当然站她那边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you not say it yourself? Stella oversees marketing, so naturally I stand on her side.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "雷总，我出去接个电话。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director Lei, let me step out to take a phone call.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天晚上恐怕不行，我想在公司加个班。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tonight probably will not work; I want to stay and work overtime at the office.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明天可能是我在星天的最后一天了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tomorrow may well be my very last day at Xingtian.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我一个人走，总比让淳于总受影响强。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Leaving on my own is far better than letting Mr Chun Yuqiao take the fallout.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你放心吧，我都已经想好了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Rest assured, I have already thought everything through.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷，你今天来得这么早，真勤劳啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, you got here so early today — how hardworking!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥，淳于总今天还没来吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kaiwen, has Mr Chun Yuqiao not arrived yet today?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大在外面有一个重要的谈判，今天我替他出席会议。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our boss has an important negotiation outside, so I am attending the meeting on his behalf today.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那凯文哥，今天一定要加油！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then give it your best today, Kaiwen!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "总监全会的系统指令已经下发了，明天我负责布置会场。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "主任说我看了这么久，明天是大结局，让我离近点看。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "边边先生，那您到底选哪边？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你不都说了吗，斯戴拉管营销，我当然站她那边。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "雷总，我出去接个电话。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今天晚上恐怕不行，我想在公司加个班。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明天可能是我在星天的最后一天了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我一个人走，总比让淳于总受影响强。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你放心吧，我都已经想好了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷，你今天来得这么早，真勤劳啊！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥，淳于总今天还没来吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大在外面有一个重要的谈判，今天我替他出席会议。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那凯文哥，今天一定要加油！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After setting up every chair in the hall, Xiaogu wishes Kaiwen luck as he steps in to represent Chun Yuqiao at the board meeting. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
